  "populations": {
    "pregnancy": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب خطر مشخصی برای بارداری ذکر نکرده یا داده کافی ندارد؛ فقط در صورت لزوم و با نظر پزشک.",
        "en": "Label states no clear risk or has limited data; use only if needed, under medical advice."
      },
      "quote": "Therefore, topical corticosteroids should be used during pregnancy only if the potential benefit justifies the potential risk to the fetus.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-triamcinolone",
          "section": "Pregnancy: Teratogenic Effects"
        }
      ]
    },
    "lactation": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در شیردهی با احتیاط؛ متن برچسب را ببینید.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Nevertheless, caution should be exercised when topical corticosteroids are administered to a nursing woman.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-triamcinolone",
          "section": "Nursing Mothers"
        }
      ]
    },
    "pediatric": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب ایمنی را فقط برای بعضی سنین کودکان تأیید کرده؛ سن را در متن برچسب ببینید.",
        "en": "Label supports use only in some paediatric ages; check the age in the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Pediatric patients may demonstrate greater susceptibility to topical corticosteroid-induced HPA axis suppression and Cushing's syndrome than mature patients because of a larger skin surface area to body weight ratio.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-triamcinolone",
